---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Polis Interface">
  <section class="hero stack">
    <h1>A resident resubmits a document after filing a complaint</h1>
    <p>
      Polis helps the resident inspect the complaints process, verify the resubmitted document in the record, and read the
      public transparency material that explains what happens next.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="process-path stack" aria-labelledby="process-path-title">
    <h2 id="process-path-title">Follow the complaint record</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <article>
          <h3>Inspect process</h3>
          <p class="muted">Check the local complaints route, the responsible role, and the next required action.</p>
          <a href="/governance/jur-croatia-local">Inspect the process map</a>
        </article>
      </li>
      <li>
        <article>
          <h3>Verify record</h3>
          <p class="muted">Confirm the resubmitted document and its supporting record before relying on it.</p>
          <a href="/verify">Verify the record</a>
        </article>
      </li>
      <li>
        <article>
          <h3>Read transparency</h3>
          <p class="muted">Read the public explanation of the demonstrator record and its limits.</p>
          <a href="/transparency">Read transparency material</a>
        </article>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <aside class="demonstrator-note" aria-labelledby="demonstrator-title">
    <h2 id="demonstrator-title">Demonstrator limits</h2>
    <p>
      This is a <strong>simulated complaints-process demonstrator</strong> using <strong>synthetic fixtures</strong> and
      <strong>development trust material</strong>. It has <strong>no government integration</strong>.
    </p>
    <dl>
      <div>
        <dt>implemented locally</dt>
        <dd>The interface and local development flow shown on this site.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>mocked</dt>
        <dd>Complaint-process entries, charter material, measures, and outputs.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>operationally accepted</dt>
        <dd>No part of this demonstrator is operationally accepted.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </aside>

  <nav class="resource-links" aria-label="Demonstrator resources">
    <a href="/governance/jur-croatia-local">Process map</a>
    <a href="/transparency">Transparency</a>
    <a href="/verify">Verify</a>
    <a href="/partners">Simulated charter</a>
    <a href="/pilot/results">Demonstrator fixture results</a>
  </nav>
</Base>

<style>
  .demonstrator-note {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 75ch;
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.42);
    border-radius: var(--polis-radius-md, 0.5rem);
    background: rgba(18, 25, 35, 0.78);
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .demonstrator-note h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .demonstrator-note p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .demonstrator-note dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
  }

  .demonstrator-note dl > div {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .demonstrator-note dt {
    color: var(--polis-primary, #38bdf8);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .demonstrator-note dd {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    color: var(--polis-muted, #9ca3af);
  }

  .process-path {
    max-width: 75ch;
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
  }

  .process-path h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .process-path ol {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .process-path li {
    min-width: 0;
    padding-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .process-path h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .process-path p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .process-path a {
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .process-path a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--polis-primary, #38bdf8);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .resource-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
  }

  .resource-links a,
  .demonstrator-note a {
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .resource-links a:focus-visible,
  .demonstrator-note a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--polis-primary, #38bdf8);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .demonstrator-note dl,
    .process-path ol {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
